00:17.530 --> 00:18.880
Hand me the old site.

00:37.280 --> 00:39.980
My first little site had a WordPress theme

00:39.980 --> 00:42.100
Blue header crooked on a secondhand screen

00:42.100 --> 00:44.440
Blocks made a page, plugs put tools in my hand

00:44.440 --> 00:46.620
First time the web felt like something I ran

00:46.620 --> 00:49.080
Years in the comments, old links all through it

00:49.080 --> 00:51.080
If you move the shop, give the street a route to it

00:51.080 --> 00:53.060
Export in hand, line the old pages up

00:53.060 --> 00:55.530
If the preview drops a story, stop and pick it back up

00:55.580 --> 00:57.060
Change The Default

00:57.060 --> 00:58.990
Leave the old links lit

00:59.780 --> 01:01.400
Keep the keys

