01:32.220 --> 01:34.740
Get Ready first, get a test page live

01:34.740 --> 01:36.900
Init writes the brief, let the owner decide

01:36.900 --> 01:39.380
EmDash in the editor, let the writer write

01:39.400 --> 01:41.460
Cloudflare Workers take the first knock at night

01:41.460 --> 01:43.900
One app for the guestbook, one to show the work

01:43.900 --> 01:46.160
Each keeps its own code and the records it serves

01:46.160 --> 01:48.470
App Composer wants the spot WordPress has held

01:48.500 --> 01:50.580
Put a working site up and let the owner tell

01:50.580 --> 01:53.040
Read the links back, let the real thing talk

01:53.040 --> 01:55.340
Keep a way home if the move goes wrong

01:55.340 --> 01:57.380
Same old stories at a different address

